# kind<TAB>residue<TAB>atoms<TAB>mean<TAB>sd<TAB>label
# `link` rows span a peptide bond: atoms before N belong to the previous
# residue. The residue is the one that follows the carbonyl; `*` is any residue
# without a row of its own.
link	*	C-N	1.329	0.014	AF
link	PRO	C-N	1.341	0.016	AF
link	*	CA-C-N	116.568	1.995	AF
link	*	C-N-CA	121.352	2.315	AF
